<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Revenue of
                                            $508 million is relatively flat compared to the second quarter of 2025, <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">primarily
                                            due to a </FONT>3% increase <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">in volumes of systems shipped coming
                                            from higher customer demand, offset by lower EyeQ ASP mainly attributable to higher-than-expected
                                            China OEM export volumes.</FONT></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 13.5pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&middot;</FONT></FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; color: #101820">Gross
                                            Margin as well as Adjusted Gross Margin </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">decreased <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">in
                                            the </FONT>second quarter <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">of </FONT>2026 <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">as
                                            compared to the prior year period. This was due to a modest reduction in EyeQ ASP mainly
                                            attributable to higher China OEM volumes which carry lower ASP and a higher portion of SuperVision
                                            related revenue with lower margin given the greater hardware content included.</FONT></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

