                                            Margin as well as Adjusted Operating Margin </FONT><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">increased
                                            in the second quarter of 2026 <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">as compared to the prior year
                                            period</FONT>. <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">The </FONT>increase <FONT STYLE="color: #101820">was
